{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"baire longest common prefix distance baire longest common prefix distance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","fileName":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 10:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Scalable Hierarchical Search]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Scalable Hierarchical Search","datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"baire longest common prefix distance baire longest common prefix distance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","fileName":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance","heading":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The Baire distance compares digit or symbol sequences by the length of their longest common prefix. Two decimal values sharing three initial digits are closer in this distance than values sharing only one. With base b, a prefix of length k can be assigned distance b to the negative k; no shared first digit receives the largest distance.\n\nThis distance is ultrametric. The shared-prefix relation immediately defines nested groups, so clustering can follow the representation's digits rather than repeatedly computing all ordinary pairwise distances. Its meaning depends on the scaling and precision of the values being encoded.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Scalable Hierarchical Search","datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"baire longest common prefix distance baire longest common prefix distance","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","fileName":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Baire Longest-Common-Prefix Distance","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Scalable Hierarchical Search","datasciencefoundations_geometry.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}